=== Subcommand run ===

Run the project

This command runs the `main` function from the `<PROJECT_NAME>` module.

Usage: run [OPTIONS] [ARGUMENTS]...

Arguments:
  [ARGUMENTS]...
          

Options:
  -t, --target <TARGET>
          The platform to target
          
          [possible values: erlang, javascript]

      --runtime <RUNTIME>
          The JavaScript runtime to target. This is only available on the JavaScript target
          
          [possible values: nodejs, deno, bun]

  -m, --module <MODULE>
          The module to run

      --no-print-progress
          Don't print progress information

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')


